{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Rouq4mM23T1792844104.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全國政協主席王滬寧陪同朝鮮領袖金正恩訪問遼寧丹東。</p><p></p><p>金正恩在王滬寧陪同下，向抗美援朝紀念塔敬獻花籃，又參觀抗美援朝紀念館，並向紀念館贈送附有他親筆題詞的歷史照片。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM 2000_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mBsiTbtVyF1792844124.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>在雙方會見中，王滬寧指，金正恩在中國人民志願軍抗美援朝作戰76周年之際，專程到訪丹東，充分體現朝方珍視中朝鮮血凝成友誼。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.KIM 2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Yggt9XR9b01792844140.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>金正恩指，今年是《朝中友好合作互助條約》簽訂65周年，感謝長期以來中方對朝方的支持與幫助，願同中方一道，傳承歷史友誼，拓展務實合作。</p><p></p><p>王滬寧亦陪同金正恩參觀丹東的汽車工廠。當金正恩離開丹東時，王滬寧到中朝新鴨綠江大橋送行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:45.856912+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:09.070054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:11.600689+00:00","content_hash":"ed8d1950c8080257938b93544f0b321a944890a8b80e99880da4e9c0a4993bc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:45.856912+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}